 website for a clinic — services, timings and appointment enquiry form.\",\"title\":\"Clinic demo\"},{\"desc\":\"A business website for a tuition centre — courses, timings and admission enquiry.\",\"title\":\"Tuition demo\"}],\"subtitle\":\"Demo websites we are building as our portfolio — a shop, a clinic and a tuition centre.\",\"title\":\"Example websites\"},\"faq\":{\"items\":[{\"a\":\"Kumbuild is a done-for-you website service. You tell us what to build, and we build the website for you. You don't need to learn code or design anything in a tool.\",\"q\":\"What is Kumbuild?\"},{\"a\":\"3–5 working days after advance payment and complete content — until you get the preview link. If content comes late, the time moves ahead.\",\"q\":\"How many days will my website take?\"},{\"a\":\"Business name, services and prices, WhatsApp number, address, timings, and real photos. The full list is on the order page.\",\"q\":\"What do I need to give you?\"},{\"a\":\"Starter ₹3,999, Business ₹7,999, Premium ₹14,999 (all draft). Yearly renewal is ₹1,999 (draft).\",\"q\":\"How much will a website cost?\"},{\"a\":\"50% advance at order time, the remaining 50% after approval, before the website goes live. Payment is through Razorpay — UPI, cards, netbanking and wallets.\",\"q\":\"How do I pay?\"},{\"a\":\"2 revision rounds are free. See the preview, tell us the changes, and we will send a new preview. Extra rounds cost extra — amount to be decided.\",\"q\":\"What if I don't like the website?\"},{\"a\":\"Fill the form on kumbuild.com/order, choose a package, create an account and pay the advance.\",\"q\":\"How do I order?\"},{\"a\":\"Login at home.kumbuild.com — Orders shows the status: Received → In progress → Preview ready → Revision → Approved → Live.\",\"q\":\"Where do I check my order status?\"},{\"a\":\"Cancel before work starts and the full advance is refunded. After work starts, the advance is not refunded.\",\"q\":\"What if I cancel my order?\"}],\"subtitle\":\"Everything people usually ask before ordering.\",\"title\":\"Frequently asked questions\"},\"footer\":{\"company\":\"Company\",\"draftNote\":\"Prices shown are draft and will be confirmed before payment.\",\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"rights\":\"All rights reserved.\",\"services\":\"Services\",\"tagline\":\"Tell us what to build.\"},\"hero\":{\"badge\":\"Done-for-you websites for small businesses\",\"ctaOrder\":\"Order my website\",\"ctaPricing\":\"See pricing\",\"note\":\"Delivery in 3–5 working days · 50% advance · 2 free revisions\",\"subtitle\":\"We build a fast, mobile-first website for your shop, clinic, tuition centre, salon or restaurant — you just tell us what you need. No code, no design tools, no hassle.\",\"title\":\"Tell us what to build.\"},\"how\":{\"steps\":[{\"desc\":\"Fill the order form — business details, package, photos and WhatsApp number.\",\"title\":\"Tell us\"},{\"desc\":\"Pay 50% advance through Razorpay — UPI, card, netbanking or wallet.\",\"title\":\"Advance\"},{\"desc\":\"We build your website and send you a preview link in 3–5 working days.\",\"title\":\"Preview\"},{\"desc\":\"Ask for changes — 2 revision rounds are free. Approve when you love it.\",\"title\":\"Approve\"},{\"desc\":\"Pay the remaining 50% and your website goes live with your domain.\",\"title\":\"Go live\"}],\"subtitle\":\"Five steps. You tell us, we build — you only review and approve.\",\"title\":\"How it works\"},\"locale\":\"en-US\",\"name\":\"English\",\"nativeName\":\"English\",\"nav\":{\"contact\":\"Contact\",\"examples\":\"Examples\",\"faq\":\"FAQ\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"howItWorks\":\"How it works\",\"login\":\"Login\",\"order\":\"Order now\",\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"services\":\"Services\"},\"order\":{\"businessName\":\"Business name\",\"businessType\":\"Business type\",\"businessTypeOptions\":[\"Shop\",\"Clinic\",\"Tuition / Coaching\",\"Salon\",\"Restaurant / Cafe\",\"Other\"],\"contentLanguage\":\"Website language\",\"message\":\"Tell us about your business (1–2 lines)\",\"name\"